kind: skit
id: rerun
title: Rerun Class
about: Vee, the old tape deck, teaches from the only tape left

[scene 1]
vee: "Class is in session. Today's rerun is episode four hundred and four."
pip: "Is that the one where the frog learns to count?"
vee: "No. That one got taped over. With a cooking show." ; do shrug

[scene 2]
clank: "I learned to bake bread. I do not have a mouth." ; do shrug
gruff: "You have a mouth. You use it to hum at the toaster."
clank: "The toaster hums back. We are close." ; do nod ; react laugh

[scene 3]
vee: "Focus, everyone! Rewind, be kind, and please stop licking the remote." ; do gasp
pip: "It tastes like Tuesday."
